 "word_count": 84, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/72/en_a1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/72/en_a1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 26.825, "size_bytes": 161856, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 84, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/72/en_a1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/72/en_a1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 23.45, "size_bytes": 141696, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 84, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/72/en_a1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/72/en_a1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 24.8, "size_bytes": 149760, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 84, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/72/en_a1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@91b304e/content/data/versions/711.json", "paragraphs": ["The show was on Sunday. Jenner wore the Fantasy Bra. It costs $50m and has 4,410 diamonds.", "Many fans were happy. But other people were angry. They said a real model should wear it.", "Jenner is 29. She is famous from TV and social media. Victoria's Secret says she is a big star.", "One model said the bra shows a big problem. She said many people have no money for food."], "paragraphs_zh": ["这场秀在周日举行。詹娜穿了那件“梦幻内衣”。它价值5000万美元，镶有4410颗钻石。", "很多粉丝很开心。但其他人很生气。他们说应该由真正的模特来穿。", "詹娜29岁。她因电视和社交媒体而出名。维多利亚的秘密说她是一位大明星。", "一位模特说，这件内衣暴露了一个大问题。她说很多人连吃饭的钱都没有。"], "body": "The show was on Sunday. Jenner wore the Fantasy Bra. It costs $50m and has 4,410 diamonds.\n\nMany fans were happy. But other people were angry. They said a real model should wear it.\n\nJenner is 29. She is f